From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement msvcr120's va_list scanf forms and _getws_s.

msvcr120's va_list scanf forms were spec stubs: vfscanf, vfscanf_s,
vfwscanf, vfwscanf_s, vscanf, vscanf_s, vwscanf, vwscanf_s, vsscanf_s and
vswscanf_s (the _s forms take buffer sizes; NULL streams, buffers or formats
call the invalid parameter handler). _getws_s, the wide gets_s, was a stub
in msvcr80 and later and ucrtbase. msvcr120_app forwards.
